            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scql",
          "text": "—a topic every Colorado parent should take seriously. A properly installed car seat reduces the risk of fatal injury in a crash by more than 70%, yet too many families unknowingly use the wrong seat, place it incorrectly, or transition too soon. At ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
